    72	  is an automorphism pair. Contrapositive: a Keller counterexample's f
    73	  is necessarily NOT one-place.
    74	- (J-1) [Jelonek; banked at SHEET6-CLASSICAL.md:267-272] Every
    75	  irreducible component of the non-properness set A(F) of a dominant
    76	  polynomial map F = (f,g): C^2 -> C^2 is the image of a polynomial map
    77	  C -> C^2, hence a rational curve with ONE place at infinity. This is
    78	  the object class on which (AM-SG) has genuine kill power for the
    79	  campaign (pre-registered: SHEET6-CLASSICAL.md:299-302).
    80	- Honest-scope inheritance: SHEET6-CLASSICAL.md:156-159 already banked
    81	  "the template fiber has >= 4 places at infinity, so the one-place
    82	  semigroup chain does NOT apply to it directly; per-place germ data
    83	  alone carries no A-M obstruction". This document sharpens that record:
    84	  it computes the actual sequences, proves the inapplicability is
    85	  structural (not contingent), and quantifies the margins.
