+Since
+
+```text
+rho_0 = D - sum_{i->0}a_i
+      = D - sum_{i in L1}a_i - sum_{i->0, prox(i)=2}a_i,
+```
+
+the correct global formula is
+
+```text
+T_ext - T_class = D - sum_{i in L1}a_i - rho_0.
+```
