+```text
+(x,xy):       D=2, T=0, kappa=1, ell=1, D=2(T+kappa)
+(xy,y):       D=2, T=0, kappa=1, ell=1, D=2(T+kappa)
+(x,x^2y^2):   D=4, T=1, kappa=1, ell=1, D=2(T+kappa)
